{"overview":"فرعونی رؤیای فاتح آینده‌ای می‌بیند که سلطنت او را تهدید خواهد کرد. با آغاز سرکوب، موسی به‌صورت مخفی به دنیا می‌آید و از قتل نوزادان نجات می‌یابد. تحت راهنمایی الهی بزرگ می‌شود تا با ستم مقابله کند و مردمش را به سوی آزادی رهبری کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A Pharaoh dreams of a future conqueror who will threaten his rule. As persecution begins, Moses is born secretly and rescued from Infanticide. Raised under divine guidance, he matures to confront tyranny and lead his people toward liberation.","tagline_en":"","runtime":135,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["ابراهیم حاتمی‌کیا"],"crew_en":["Ebrahim Hatamikia"],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"مریلا زارعی","role":"Jochebed","photo":"/cdQ7pLnZw3OpnorL9muH5m1RQ9k.jpg","en":"Merila Zarei"},{"name":"علیرضا کمالی","role":"Amram","photo":"/fLFwSC9KpoTuuC4nreiI1nCcP4R.jpg","en":"Alireza Kamali"},{"name":"بهنام تشکر","role":"Pharaoh","photo":"/4a7g1hnUsGaOaUchWePdBxn9ESA.jpg","en":"Behnam Tashakkor"},{"name":"بهاره کیان‌افشار","role":"Asiya","photo":"/35lOm1jgooCI8LDn83MwyW4Lfmq.jpg","en":"Bahare Kianafshar"},{"name":"فرهاد آئیش","role":"Anubis","photo":"/iwvTS0q3JzT1uwNwV2uiP5o21kv.jpg","en":"Farhad Aeish"},{"name":"شکیب شجره","role":"Ramos","photo":"/b3A71z7owGBqmOgqwINWz8FCjqq.jpg","en":"Shakib Shajareh"},{"name":"Toofan Mehrdadian","role":"Ankh Mahur","photo":"/iju3sXIKzsTdpOJFGKY3xaxy6Ge.jpg"},{"name":"Maryam Sarmadi","role":"Fuahed","photo":"/sxb337ON3lfyNOTXZg7926uN5Ql.jpg"},{"name":"Masoud Rahimpoor","role":"Haman","photo":"/amOyuS2n6eEQ82D8TyeyQQh3aR1.jpg"},{"name":"Bahar Noohian","role":"Hebrew woman","photo":"/caQH4qYOVrmaQuhFR1TN2IauN29.jpg"}],"trailer":"ff3yWRT8ePw","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1417435"}